{"id":"en_resisting-mr-lloyd-an-age-gap-romance","title":"Resisting Mr. Lloyd: An Age Gap Romance","titleEn":"Resisting Mr. Lloyd: An Age Gap Romance","description":"Clarisse is under pressure from her family to leave college and get married, but her situation shifts after she comes to the aid of an elderly woman who has been scammed. That woman's grandson is Austin, the head of Lloyd Group. Once he learns about Clarisse's money troubles, he proposes a deal: he will provide financial help if she agrees to a sham marriage that would satisfy his grandmother's wish. She accepts, and the two enter into an arrangement neither expected, all while Austin hides who he really is from her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/resisting-mr-lloyd-an-age-gap-romance/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/resisting-mr-lloyd-an-age-gap-romance/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Age gap","Romance","Sweet Romance","Identity Reveal","Classic","Romance"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsr9q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_resisting-mr-lloyd-an-age-gap-romance_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsr9q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_resisting-mr-lloyd-an-age-gap-romance_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsr9q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_resisting-mr-lloyd-an-age-gap-romance_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsr9q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_resisting-mr-lloyd-an-age-gap-romance_4","title":"Epis